{
    "background_story": "Sweets was a mysterious and enigmatic figure, known only by her alias. She was a ritualist, a practitioner of ancient and forgotten arts. Her true name was whispered in hushed tones among the occult communities, and few had ever laid eyes on her. Sweets was said to possess an uncanny ability to weave magic into the fabric of reality, bending the threads of fate to her will. Her rituals were shrouded in secrecy, but those who claimed to have witnessed them spoke of mesmerizing ceremonies that blurred the lines between reality and the unknown. Some said she communed with spirits, while others whispered that she was a spirit herself, a vessel for forces beyond human comprehension. One thing was certain: those who sought Sweets' services did so at their own peril, for her rituals came with a steep price, one that only the most desperate or foolhardy were willing to pay.",
